WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,550
Lao Pei

2
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,200
I want to avenge you

3
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,560
That's why he was beaten into such a ghostly state

4
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:06,000
You and Lao Wang have the nerve to beat him up

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:07,120
I have to send him away today

6
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,120
It won’t be swollen either

7
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:11,040
You two old guys, are you serious?

8
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:17,720
I'm really unfilial. Wait until something big happens to Lao Pei before that monster comes.

9
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,680
During the tea dinner, I asked you where the gate of the Vajra Gate is.

10
00:00:20,080 --> 00:00:21,680
He asked about my Vajra Gate doing good deeds

11
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,960
All my disciples and grandsons are at the door.

12
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:26,320
If you kill that humanoid demon quickly,

13
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,880
Take the back mountain entrance and return to the Vajra Gate

14
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,600
Maybe you can still dare to stop him in front of that monster?

15
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:32,080
Where did the three wild pig loins come from?

16
00:00:32,080 --> 00:00:34,720
Those who dare to break into the Vajra Gate without permission are looking for death. You are a bastard.

17
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,800
The dog eyes that scared you are you.

18
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:40,000
You are the founder of the mountain, how come you are

19
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,840
What are you looking at when you beat a pig's head to pieces?

20
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:43,440
These two are Zhang Kui, the ancestor of Shenquan Sect.

21
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:44,360
Xue Tong, the leader of the Golden Knife Sect

22
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:46,040
So do they, I'll go

23
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:50,160
Where did those three big fat pigs come from? What happened to me?

24
00:00:50,160 --> 00:00:52,520
Why is there such a dead atmosphere in the store?

25
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:56,040
Something big happened. Someone used his nose and hand on the stone monument at the mountain gate early yesterday morning.

26
00:00:56,040 --> 00:00:57,120
Keep an eye on this battle iron seal

27
00:00:58,020 --> 00:01:00,780
Grandma Ghost Hands, the three of you joined forces back then

28
00:01:00,780 --> 00:01:01,820
Killed his only son

29
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,260
He has been in hiding for thirty years and now

30
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,140
Why are you so worried when you come to collect debts?

31
00:01:05,140 --> 00:01:06,220
No matter how powerful that old woman is

32
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:07,420
Just alone

33
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:10,180
We have hundreds of houses in the Vajra Gate, but we are still afraid that none of him will be a match.

34
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:11,940
I and Brother Xue are also fighting with him.
